    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2144$45 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 10 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2019'10'10No. 2144/45 - THURSDAY OCTOBER 10, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE MATALE PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Matale Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of not attending threeconsecutive meeting of the council without permission ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to which KonaraMudiyanselage Gewaththe Gedara Chaminda Kumara Konara the member belonged, was required by me under Section66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide upon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to suchparty and is not disqualified under Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declaredselected as a member within a period of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Palle Kankanamage Don Chandana to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Prathapasingha Arachchige Kumarini Dasanthi, Returning Officer of the Matale PradeshiyaSabha, acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declarethat Palle Kankanamage Don Chandana was selected as the member of the Matale Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nP. A. K. DASANTHI,Returning Officer,Matale Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Matale,08th October, 2019.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
