    "chunk_size_bytes": 1750,
    "chunk_text": "2AI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'10PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 10.10.2019\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n10 -902\n\nComplete information relation to physical characteristics of the abovementioned airports and the facilities, andservices available at those airports including the operational hours of the airports has been provided in the Sri LankaAeronautical Information Publication (AIP), which is published in the official website of the Civil Aviation Authority ofSri Lanka (www.caa.lk).\n\nAircraft arriving in Sri Lanka or departing to overseas destinations may land firstly at or depart lastly from theabove-mentioned Airports and such aircraft may disembark and embark, passengers, cargo and mail as applicable on suchflights at those airport.\n\nEvery aircraft operating into and out of the abovementioned airports shall conform to the applicable nationallaws, regulations, rules and implementing standards relating to border controls and the established operating proceduresrelating to entry and departure of aircraft, which are published in the AIP.\n\nEvery departing and arriving passenger, in and out of the abovementioned airports shall conform to the applicablenational laws, regulations, rules and implementing standards and also the established operating procedures relating toentry and departure of persons and baggage and they may be subject to the applicable screening processes that will beperformed by the respective government authorities in charge of customs, immigration and emigration, aviation security,public health, plant and animal quarantine and narcotics control etc."
