    "chunk_text": "Every departing and arriving passenger, in and out of the abovementioned airports shall conform to the applicablenational laws, regulations, rules and implementing standards and also the established operating procedures relating toentry and departure of persons and baggage and they may be subject to the applicable screening processes that will beperformed by the respective government authorities in charge of customs, immigration and emigration, aviation security,public health, plant and animal quarantine and narcotics control etc.\n\nNo person inclusive of any item carried by that person or vehicle is permitted enter or remain in any area whichis designated as Security Restricted Area of the aforementioned airports unless such person or vehicle has been issuedwith a valid airpot access permit by the Airport Operator and the access permit is displayed conspicuously for inspection.The foregoing condition is not applicable to a passenger holding valid travel documents and a current boarding pass for aninbound flight terminating at or outbound flight originating from those airports, if the passengers complies with thesecurity screening procedures.\n\nOperation of unmanned aerial vehicles including drones within and in the vicinity of the airport premises iscompletely prohibited\n\nH. M. C. NIMALSIRI,Director General of Civil Aviation."
