    "chunk_text": "North by : Paddy field claimed by W.A. Kamalawathie (Demata Gahawatta Kumbura) East by : Land claimed by S. Gunasekara (balance portion of Amunewele Gedara Watta) South by : Road running from Rattota to Ilukkumbura (Road Development Authority) West by : Land claimed by G.G. Karunaratne balance portion of Amunewele Gedara Watta\n\nSCHEDULE (Contd.) Names and addresses of the claimants of the land : Lot No. 1 1. Chief Incumbent, Gale Viharaya, Pallegama, Rattota. 2. Mr. P.G. Jayasinghe (Anda rights), Dikkumbura, No. 71/1, Nikolaya road, Rattota. Lot No. 2 1. Mr. A.G.Kiribanda, Dikkumbura, Rattota. Lot No. 3 1. Mr. K.G. Jayawardhana, No. 21, Wanaraniya road, Rattota. Lot No. 4 1. Mr. S. Gunasekara, No. 21, Wanaraniya road, Rattota. Lot No. 5 1. Mrs. G.G. Sumanawathie, No. 163, Nikolaya road, Rattota. 10 - 956\n\nNATIONAL WATER SUPPLY AND DRAINAGE BOARD ACT, No.2 OF 1974\n\nOrder under Section 92\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Rauff Hakeem, the Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, here by approve, the the servitude rights of an allotment of land described in the following schedule as it is required by the said board, to lay pumping line from treatment plant under Matara Stage IV Water Supply Project.\n\nRAUFF HAKEEM, Minister of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education. Ministry of City Planning, Water Supply and Higher Education, No. 35, ''Lakdiya Medura\", New Parliament Road, Pelawatta, Battaramulla, 02nd October, 2019. 5/2/2/1506\n\n4 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.11 PART (I): SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SO