    "chunk_text": "IV ^w& jeks fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'12PART IV (A) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 12.10.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nw;s \u00fafYIThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (A) \u2013 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nAppointment & C., by the Governors\n\nwxl 2144$67 \u2013 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 12 jeks fikiqrdod \u2013 2019'10'12No. 2144/67 \u2013 SATURDAY, OCTOBER 12, 2019\n\nUVA PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nAppointments by the Governor of the Uva Province\n\nBY virtue of powers vested in me uder Section 32(1) of the Provincial Council Act No. 42 of 1987, I, Maithri Gunaratne, Governorof the Uva Province, do hereby notify that the following appointments have been made by me.\n\n01. Mrs. D. M. Vineetha Dissanayake, Retired Grade I officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, has been re-appointedon contract basis as the Director of Rural Development of Uva Province, from the date 20.08.2019 till the appointmentof a Permanent officer or up to 19.08.2020.\n\n02. Mrs. S. B. A. M. A. M. Gunawardana, Grade I officer of the Sri Lanka Agricultural Service, as the Provincial Director toAgriculture of Uva Province, with immediate effect (from the date 09.09.2019).\n\n03. Mr. W. M. Ananda, Special Grade officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to perform the Duties of the Secretaryto the Governor of Uva Province, from the date 15.09.2019 till the return to the Island of Mr. R. M. T. B. Hathiyaldeniya,who is the Secretary to the Governor of Uva Province.\n\n04. Mr. W. M. Ananda, Special Grade officer of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service, to perform the Duties of the Directorto the Institute of Uva Management Development, from the date 15.09.2019 till the return to the Island of Mr. R. M. T.B. Hathiyaldeniya, who is the Acting Director to the Institute of Uva Management Development."
  },
