    "chunk_text": "1AIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'10'14PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 14.10.2019\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nORDER UNDER PROVISO (a) TO SECTION 38\n\nOrder No. 206 of 2019\n\nMy Ref. No. : 4-3/16/2018/UDA/306.Sec. Ref. No. : EP/LD/09/1/25'\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Proviso (a) to Section 38 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Gayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms do hereby direct theAcquiring Officer or any other officer authorized by him referred toin Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take immediate possession of theland specified in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of thatSchedule.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMinistry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.14th October, 2019.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring Officer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Elpitiya.\n\n2. Description of the land.- Allotment of lands depicted in thebelow names and extents in the Advanced Tracing No. GA/ELP/2018/754 dated 19.09.2019 prepared by the Surveyor-General,situated in the village called Igala in the Grama Niladari Division\u2019sNo. 26D, Igala South in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Elpitiyain Galle District in Southern Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Igalawela Pahala Kattiya \u2013 Extent: About0.2195 HectareNorth: Igalawela Pahala Kattiya claimed by J.D. Don GaminiPerera and some others; East: Lots E and D; South: Lots D, C and B;West: Lot B, Canel and Igalawela Pahala Kattiya claimed by J.D.Don Gamini Perera and some others.\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 \u2013 Igalawela Pahala Kattiya \u2013 Extent:About 0.0399 HectareNorth: Lot A; East: Lots A, D and C; South: Lot C and Canel;West: Canel.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%s