    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2019'08'27PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 27.08.20191A\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%hThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nw;s \u00fafYI EXTRAORDINARY\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nwxl 2145$21 \u2013 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be 14 jeks i\u00f7od \u2013 2019'10'14No. 2145/21 \u2013 MONDAY, OCTOBER 14, 2019\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A \u2013 G 31258 \u2013 16 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and Parliamentary\n\nReforms, do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the\n\nLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below is needed for a\n\npublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nAn allotment of land depicted in below name and extent in the\n\nAdvanced Tracing No. Ku/PNN/2017/450 dated 04.05.2018\n\nprepared by the Surveyor-General and situated in the Village called\n\nIngaradavula in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 1553 of\n\nIngaradavula, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pannala in\n\nKurunegala District of the North Western Province and bounded as\n\nfollows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Indigahawelawatta \u2013 Extent: 0.6035 HectareNorth: Indigahawelawatta claimed by W. A. Somapala,Indigahawelawatta claimed by J. A. Gunathunga, Indigahawelawattaclaimed by J. A. Kusumawathi and Playground; East: Playgroundand Pradeshiya Sabha Road; South: Pradeshiya Sabha Road and landin which the Grama Niladari Office is situated; West: PradeshiyaSabha Road and Indigahawelawatta claimed by W. A. Somapala.\n\nGayantha Karunatilleke,Minister of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/8/2017/PC/63.Ministry of Lands and Parliamentary Reforms,\u2018\u2018Mihikatha Medura\u2019\u2019Rajamalwatta Road,Battaramulla.11th July, 2019.\n\n11 - 28\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA"
