    "chunk_text": "wxl 2145$25 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 15 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'10'15No. 2145/25 \u2013 TUESDAY, OCTOBER 15, 2019\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nYS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lkG 31263 - 32 (10/2019)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT, (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No. : 2017/06. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 4-3/6/2016/HW/242.\n\nI hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquirethe following lands which are required for a public purpose.\n\nDescription of the Land to be acquired :\n\nLot Nos. (1 - 5) Lots 05 allotments of land in Total Extent ofabout 0.0211 Hectare, in Preliminary Plan No. Mara 2786 anddated 12.07.2019 prepared by the Senior - Superintendent ofSurveyor of Matara District on behalf of the Surveyor General,situated in the Village of Kadawedduma in the GramaNiladhari Division of Uduwa East, No.333, in theDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Thihagoda, in MataraDistrict in the Southern Province.\n\n01. Lot No. 1Name of land: Dombagahakoratuwa; Description: Garden,Contains a mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; OriginalClaimant: A. C. Senerath Yapa, \"Nisansala\", Kadawedduma,Yatiyana (To finalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0026Hectare.\n\n02. Lot No. 2Name of land: Paragahawatta; Description: Garden, Containsa mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: C. W.Jayasekara (To finalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0028Hectare.\n\n03. Lot No. 3Name of land: Paragahawatta; Description: Garden, Containsa mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: S. A.Nihal, Walavva, Kadawedduma, Yatiyana (To finalize the landacquisition); Extent: 0.0083 Hectare."
