    "chunk_text": "03. Lot No. 3Name of land: Paragahawatta; Description: Garden, Containsa mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: S. A.Nihal, Walavva, Kadawedduma, Yatiyana (To finalize the landacquisition); Extent: 0.0083 Hectare.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n04. Lot No. 4Name of land: Koopywatta; Description: Garden, Containsa mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:Jayathunga Arachchi, \"Kusum Sevena\" Kadawedduma,Yatiyana (To finalize the land acquisition); Extent: 0.0020Hectare.\n\n05. Lot No. 5Name of land: Koopywatta; Description: Garden, Containsa mixed cultivation; Claimant: State; Original Claimant:Nandathilaka Koralage and Nandana Koralage, Koopywatta,Kadawedduma, Yatiyana (To finalize the land acquisition);Extent: 0.0054 Hectare.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid lands are herebyrequired to appear personally or by agent duly authorized inwriting, before me at Divisional Secretariat office of Thihagodaon the 14.11.2019 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 07.11.2019the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for compensation for the acquisition of the said lands,the amount of compensation and the details of the computationof such amount.\n\nUMESHA SURANGI MATARAGE,Divisional Secretary andAcquiring Officer,Thihagoda.\n\nDivisional Secretary's Office,07th October, 2019.\n\n11-49\n\nAMENDMENT\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT, (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Reference No.: KRP/LND/ACQVI/01/25-V.\n\nLand Ministry Ref. No. : 4-3/6/2015/Hw/289."
