    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'15Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 15.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2145$27 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 15 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'10'15No. 2145/27 - TUESDAY OCTOBER 15, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KATUWANA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of member of Katuwana Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to which MunasingeSirisena the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decide uponreturned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 of theLocal Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Hewa Kuda Anthonige Ananda Kulasundara to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Ravindra Subhashana Wedage, Returning Officer of the Katuwana Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatHewa Kuda Anthonige Ananda Kulasundara was selected as the member of the Katuwana Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nRAVINDRA SUBHASHANA WEDAGE,Returning Officer,Katuwana Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Hambantota,14th October, 2019.\n\n11 - 53\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
