    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'15Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 15.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2145$28 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 15 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'10'15No. 2145/28 - TUESDAY OCTOBER 15, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KARANDENIYAPRADESHIYA SABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONSORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of a return member of Karandeniya Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason ofResignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which GurusingheDapanadurage Ranjanie Mangalika the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaidordinance, to decide upon returned member of United National Party who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Kaluwa Dewa Chandrika Kanthi Weerasinghe to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Kanda Uda Chandralal, Returning Officer of the Karandeniya Pradeshiya Sabha, actingin terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare that KaluwaDewa Chandrika Kanthi Weerasinghe was selected as the member of the Karandeniya Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nK. U. CHANRALAL,Returning Officer,Karandeniya Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Galle,14th October, 2019.\n\n11 - 54/1\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A - G 31266\u2014 27 (10/2019)"
