    "chunk_text": "MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. 12th day of October, 2019. Polonnaruwa.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 : (1) \u0dd9\u014e\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.16 PART I : Sec (1) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.10.2019\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nBy North : Lot Number 1 (Mee oya) of F. V. P. 3300, lot Number 6 (Mee oya) of F. V. P. 3301. By East : Lot number 57, 58 (Road Reserve of Anuradhapura-Kurunegala Road of Road Development Authority) lot number 59, 60, 61 of F. V. P. 3301, lot number 308 (Road Reserve of Anuradhapura-Kurunegala Road of Road Development Authority) 307, 309 of F. V. P. 3303. By South : Lot number 309 (Road from Kasicoat to Peella), 27 and 310 (Road Reserve of Road from Kasicoat to Peella), 311 of F. V. P. 3303. By West : Lot number 312 of F. V. P. 3303, lot number 62, 51, 63 of F. V. P. 3301, Road from Mee oya to Kasicoat, lot number 148, 22 (tank), road from chenas to tank of F. V. P. 3300. Extent: 466.691 ha 11 - 72\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE\n\nTHE order under Section 3. that has to be read with Section 64.(1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order\n\nBy virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19thamendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, Precedent do by this order declare the Thorapitiya Forest of 64.0458 Hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedule hereto as Thorapitiya Reserved Forest from 12th day of October, 2019.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President."
