a Ella tank) of F.V.P.306.\n\nBy West: Lot number 352, (Ratna Ella tank), 353, 354 of F.V.P.306. Extent: 64.0458 Ha. 11 - 94\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE"
