    "chunk_text": "MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. 12th day of October 2019, Polonnaruwa.\n\n2 A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 : (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.16 PART I : Sec (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.10.2019\n\nFOREST CONSERVATION ORDINANCE\n\n3A I \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 : (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba - \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba - 2019.10.16 PART I : Sec (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.10.2019\n\nTHE order under section 3. that has to be read with Section 64.(1) of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451), as No. 13 of 1966, as amended by Acts, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009 that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\n\nThe Order By virtue of powers vested in me by section 3. of the Forest Conservation Ordinance (Chapter 451) as amended by Acts, No. 13 of 1966, No. 56 of 1979, No. 13 of 1982, No. 84 of 1988, No. 23 of 1995 and No. 65 of 2009, that have to be read with Section 51 of the 19th amendment of the Constitution of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President do by this order declare the Lankapatuna Mangrove Forest of 616.274 hectares bounded by the limit set forth in the schedule hereto as Lankapatuna Mangrove Reserved Forest from 12th day of Octo-ber 2019.\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA, President. 12th day of October 2019, Polonnaruwa."
