    "chunk_text": "IV ^wd& jeks fldgi \u2013 YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'06'03Part IV (B) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 03.06.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2145$54 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 19 jeks fikiqrdod - 2019'10'19No. 2145/54 - SATURDAY OCTOBER 19, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nFILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE LANKAPURA PRADESHIYASABHA UNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262)\n\nWHEREAS the office of return member of Lankapura Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of Resignation ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the People\u2019s Liberation Front, the recognized political party to which GarumuniGamini de Soysa the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66 A (1) of the aforesaid ordinance, to decideupon returned member of People\u2019s Liberation Front who belongs to such party and is not disqualified under Section 9 ofthe Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within a period of thirty (30)days ;\n\nAND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party has communicated his decision tonominate Thewarapperuma Arachchige Indika Priyadharshana to fill such vacancy ;\n\nNOW THEREFORE, I, Leelanath Wickrama Arachchi, Returning Officer of the Lankapura Pradeshiya Sabha,acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatThewarapperuma Arachchige Indika Priyadharshana was selected as the member of the Lankapura Pradeshiya Sabha.\n\nLEELANATH WICKRAMA ARACHCHI,Returning Officer,Lankapura Pradeshiya Sabha.District Election Office,Polonnaruwa,17th October, 2019.\n\n11 - 481\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART IV (B) \u2014 LOCAL GOVERNMENT\n\nNotices under the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance"
