    "chunk_size_bytes": 1986,
    "chunk_text": "Regulations mentioned in the following paragraphs, numbered as 1,4,6,8,9,13 and 14 published in the Government GazetteExtraordinary Number 2112/32 dated 28.02.2019, of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka for the MeritoriousService Medal are hereby amended by His Excellency the President:\n\nBy His Excellency's command,\n\nUDAYA R SENEVIRATNE,Secretary to the President.\n\nOffice of Secretary to the President,Colombo,16th October 2019.\n\nSEVABHIMANI PADAKKAMA\n\n1. The Medal shall be awarded to the Minister of Defence, the State Minister of Defence, the Secretary of De-fence of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka for the valuable contribution made since 19.05.2009 and all Ranksof the Regular and Volunteer Forces of the Army, Navy and Air Force and members of the Sri Lanka Police who have beenin active service on Nineteen day of May Two Thousand Nine or thereafter, and who have completed an aggregate period ofSix Years excluding the basic training period with a good conduct and the permanent civil staff members with Six years ofaggregate service in Armed Services and Affiliates of the Sri Lank Police.\n\n4. A Board of not less than three Senior Officers nominated by the respective Service Commanders will examinethe recommendations made for the award of the SEVABHIMANI PADAKKAMA. The recommendations of the Board alongwith the recommendations of the respective Service Commanders will be forwarded to His Excellency the Presidentthrough the Secretary, Defence for His Excellency\u2019s approval. The recommendations of the Minister of Defence, the StateMinister of Defence and the Secretary of Defence of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka should be sentdirectly by the Secretary of Defence for His Excellency\u2019s approval.\n\n6. The names of persons whom the Medal is conferred upon, shall be published in the respective Service Ordersand a register of all such recipients shall be maintained under the direction of the respective Service Commander."
