    "chunk_text": "REGULATIONS mentioned in the following paragraphs, numbered as 1,4,6,8,9,13 and 14 published in the GovernmentGazette Extraordinary Number 2112/32 dated 28.02.2019, of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka for theService Medal are hereby amended:\n\nBy His Excellency's command,\n\nUDAYA R SENEVIRATNE,Secretary to the President.\n\nSEVA PADAKKAMA\n\n1. The Medal shall be awarded to the Minister of Defence, the State Minister of Defence, the Secretary of De-fence of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka for the valuable contribution made since 19.05.2009 and all Ranksof the Regular and Volunteer Forces of the Army, Navy and Air Force and members of the Sri Lanka Police who have beenin active service on Nineteen day of May Two Thousand Nine or thereafter, and who have completed an aggregate period ofThree Years excluding the basic training period with a good conduct and the permanent civil staff members with three yearsof aggregate service in Armed Services and Affiliates of the Sri Lanka Police.\n\n4. A Board of not less than three Senior Officers nominated by the respective Service Commanders and InspectorGeneral of Police will examine the recommendations made for the award of the SERVICE MEDAL. The recommendationsof the Board along with the recommendations of the respective Service Commanders and Inspector General of Police willbe forwarded to His Excellency the President through the Secretary of Defence, for His Excellency\u2019s approval. The recom-mendations of the Minister of Defence, the State Minister of Defence and the Secretary of Defence of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka should be sent directly by the Secretary of Defence for His Excellency\u2019s approval."
