    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2146$22 - 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 22 jeks w\u00d5yrejdod - 2019'10'22\n\nNo. 2146/22 - TUESDAY, OCTOBER 22, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www. documents.gov.lk 1A - G 031321 - 10 (10/2019)\n\n3rd Amendment\n\nSERVICE MINUTE OF THE SRI LANKA AGRICULTURE SERVICE\n\nTHE Service Minute of the Sri Lanka Agriculture Service published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1880/26 dated 19th ofSeptember 2014 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as amended by the Gazettes Extraordinary No. 1971/17dated 15th of June 2016 and No. 2032/33 dated 17th of August 2017 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka isamended as follows and these amended provisions will be made effective from 26th of February 2019, the date on which theCabinet of Ministers made the policy decision.\n\nBy order of the Public Service Commission,\n\nM. A. B. DAYA SENARATH,\n\nSecretary,Public Service Commission.\n\n04th October, 2019.\n\n10.1.1.1\n\nII. Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade III of the Category\n\nof Service and earned six (06) salary increments.\n\n2 AI fldgi: (I) fPoh - Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'22PART 1: SEC. (1) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 22.10.2019\n\nIII. Should have demonstrated a performance at satisfactory level or above during six (06) years immediately preceding\n\nthe date of promotion in accordance with the approved procedure of performance appraisal.\n\n10.2.1\n\n(I) Should have completed at least six (06) years of active and satisfactory period of service in Grade II of the category\n\nof service and earned six (06) salary increments."
