    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'10'11PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA -11.10.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2146$39- 2019 Tlaf;dan\u00be ui 27 jeks brsod - 2019'10'27No. 2146/39 - SUNDAY, OCTOBER 27, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nGuidelines issued by the Election Commission in addition to the Media Guidelines published in the Gazette No.2141/87 of 21.09.2019.\n\n1.Photographs or declarations of public officers who do not have political rights or of members of Armed forcesand police officers who have are in active service or photographs taken and declarations made by retired officerswhile they were in active service and in uniform, should not be published through electronic, print, social or anyother media to promote or prejudice a party or a candidate.\n\n2.Photographs should not be taken and videoing inside polling stations should not be done without the writtenapproval of the Election Commission. Photographs or videos taken inside a polling station or a postal votingcentre taken without authority should not be published through electronic, print or social media.\n\n3.Unofficial results of the poll should not be published untill they are officially declared by the ElectionCommission.\n\nMAHINDA DESHAPRIYAN. J. ABEYSEKERES. RATNAJEEVAN, H. HOOLEChairmanMemberMemberElection CommissionElection CommissionElection Commission\n\nColombo,27th October, 2019.\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A- PG 4723\u2014 267 (10/2019)PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
